        "body": "<p><em>Pacha Mana is a bridge. Between a family farm in the Peruvian highlands and your shelf. Between the rarest heirloom cacao on earth and the person who drinks it. We source one variety, Chuncho, directly from the families who grow it, pay them 3x the market rate, and make every blend fresh in small batches in California.</em></p><p><em>Carry Pacha Mana and you carry the whole story: traceable, alive, and rooted in reciprocity. That's what your customers are really buying.</em></p>",
